    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530860/extras/755ca2318815839b8fbf2b0bb39c34b3.webp?t=1744192497\" width=616 height=58 /></span>Ever dreamed of running your own tea tavern? In your cozy teavern, you can create delightful treats - from melon bun sandwiches to fragrant milk tea with spices. Experiment with recipes and surprise your guests with unique flavors!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530860/extras/cab9204c7d1f2d6ea0abeb171208808d.poster.avif?t=1744192497\" width=616 height=347 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530860/extras/cab9204c7d1f2d6ea0abeb171208808d.webm?t=1744192497\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530860/extras/14ceee0869c3982f5af38e50f02df2c4.webp?t=1744192497\" width=616 height=58 /></span>Make your teavern truly yours! Choose decorations, arrange furniture, and design a space that reflects your style. The cozier your cafe, the more rewards you\u2019ll unlock!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530860/extras/9d8f5b40609617cc036088a1a3114833.poster.avif?t=1744192497\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530860/extras/9d8f5b40609617cc036088a1a3114833.webm?t=1744192497\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530860/extras/9d8f5b40609617cc036088a1a3114833.mp4?t=1744192497\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530860/extras/579d6182117193c66fe6d2e48a16a618.webp?t=1744192497\" width=616 height=58 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Fiora, a mushroom girl running a tea tavern in a whimsical world made of sweets. Greet visitors, take your time, and embrace a slow-paced, stress-free experience - unless you decide to challenge yourself by choice!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530860/extras/d6d18b3deafa86ae46b226e74a43309e.poster.avif?t=1744192497\" width=616 height=347 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530860/extras/d6d18b3deafa86ae46b226e74a43309e.webm?t=1744192497\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530860/extras/89e6248c19a1d64f1ec713bbb101c604.avif?t=1744192497\" width=616 height=86 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every guest has a story to share. Listen to their tales over a cup of tea, learn more about their lives, and collect special keepsakes from your favorite customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530860/extras/d851a9c65064149a016fadf176de17b4.avif?t=1744192497\" width=616 height=323 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530860/extras/aa0779a227c52a73e4c454379abbf076.webp?t=1744192497\" width=616 height=58 /></span>Play through the story mode to get to know your visitors and grow your tavern, or enjoy endless orders at your own pace in free play mode. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc96Are you ready to open the doors to your cozy teavern? \ud83c\udf70\u2615\ufe0f</strong> </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530860/extras/755ca2318815839b8fbf2b0bb39c34b3.webp?t=1744192497\" width=616 height=58 /></span>Ever dreamed of running your own tea tavern? In your cozy teavern, you can create delightful treats - from melon bun sandwiches to fragrant milk tea with spices. Experiment with recipes and surprise your guests with unique flavors!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530860/extras/cab9204c7d1f2d6ea0abeb171208808d.poster.avif?t=1744192497\" width=616 height=347 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530860/extras/cab9204c7d1f2d6ea0abeb171208808d.webm?t=1744192497\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530860/extras/14ceee0869c3982f5af38e50f02df2c4.webp?t=1744192497\" width=616 height=58 /></span>Make your teavern truly yours! Choose decorations, arrange furniture, and design a space that reflects your style. The cozier your cafe, the more rewards you\u2019ll unlock!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530860/extras/9d8f5b40609617cc036088a1a3114833.poster.avif?t=1744192497\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530860/extras/9d8f5b40609617cc036088a1a3114833.webm?t=1744192497\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530860/extras/9d8f5b40609617cc036088a1a3114833.mp4?t=1744192497\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530860/extras/579d6182117193c66fe6d2e48a16a618.webp?t=1744192497\" width=616 height=58 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Fiora, a mushroom girl running a tea tavern in a whimsical world made of sweets. Greet visitors, take your time, and embrace a slow-paced, stress-free experience - unless you decide to challenge yourself by choice!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530860/extras/d6d18b3deafa86ae46b226e74a43309e.poster.avif?t=1744192497\" width=616 height=347 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530860/extras/d6d18b3deafa86ae46b226e74a43309e.webm?t=1744192497\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530860/extras/89e6248c19a1d64f1ec713bbb101c604.avif?t=1744192497\" width=616 height=86 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every guest has a story to share. Listen to their tales over a cup of tea, learn more about their lives, and collect special keepsakes from your favorite customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530860/extras/d851a9c65064149a016fadf176de17b4.avif?t=1744192497\" width=616 height=323 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530860/extras/aa0779a227c52a73e4c454379abbf076.webp?t=1744192497\" width=616 height=58 /></span>Play through the story mode to get to know your visitors and grow your tavern, or enjoy endless orders at your own pace in free play mode. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc96Are you ready to open the doors to your cozy teavern? \ud83c\udf70\u2615\ufe0f</strong> </p>",
    "short_description": "Welcome to a cozy tea tavern in a world made of sweets! \ud83c\udf75\u2728 Take orders, prepare desserts and drinks, chat with visitors, and customize your caf\u00e9. No timers, no stress - just cozyness, sweets and heartwarming stories.",
